{
  "format": "aavanam-vector/v1",
  "title": "An import of a delta bundle fails if the parent of an excerpt has a base digest whose bytes the store does not have",
  "clauses": [
    "BUN-DLT-4",
    "BUN-RED-4",
    "BUN-EXC-3",
    "BUN-IMP-2",
    "BUN-IMP-4"
  ],
  "provenance": {
    "type": "spec",
    "note": "The first export permits only the value redistributable, so it withholds the bytes of the reading rd, and the device store keeps rd without bytes. The delta export has no permit, so it withholds no digest, and it leaves the bytes of rd out as a base digest. The new excerpt ex has the parent rd. Rule 3 of BUN-DLT-4 gives failed with bundle_incomplete, because the check of BUN-EXC-3 needs the bytes of the parent, and they are in neither the bundle nor the store."
  },
